    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s0011",
          "zh": "澤潞節度增領懷、衛二州，尋以衛州還相衛節度。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "The Ze-Lu circuit added jurisdiction over Huai and Wei prefectures; soon Wei Prefecture was returned to the Xiang-Wei circuit.",
              "idiomatic": "The Ze–Lu circuit took Huai and Wei under its command; before long Wei Prefecture was transferred back to the Xiang–Wei circuit.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "translations": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "id": "s0012",
          "zh": "成德軍節度增領冀州。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "The Chengde Army circuit added Jizhou to its jurisdiction.",
              "idiomatic": "The Chengde Army circuit gained jurisdiction over Jizhou.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s0013",
          "zh": "冀州隸成德軍節度，罷領順、易、歸順三州。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "Jizhou was placed under the Chengde Army circuit; jurisdiction over Shun, Yi, and Guishun prefectures was discontinued.",
              "idiomatic": "Jizhou was assigned to the Chengde Army circuit, which relinquished Shun, Yi, and Guishun.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s0014",
          "zh": "置魏博等州防禦使，領魏、博、貝、瀛、滄五州，治魏州。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "A defense commissioner for Wei-Bo and other prefectures was established, holding Wei, Bo, Bei, Ying, and Cang prefectures, with seat at Wei Prefecture.",
              "idiomatic": "A defense commissioner for Wei–Bo and neighboring prefectures was installed, commanding Wei, Bo, Bei, Ying, and Cang from his seat at Wei Prefecture.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s0015",
          "zh": "是年，升為節度使，增領德州。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "That year it was promoted to military commissioner and added De Prefecture to its jurisdiction.",
              "idiomatic": "That same year the post was raised to military commissioner, and De Prefecture was added to its command.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s0016",
          "zh": "以瀛、滄二州隸淄青平盧節度，貝州隸洺相節度。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "Ying and Cang prefectures were placed under the Ziqing Pinglu circuit; Bei Prefecture under the Ming-Xiang circuit.",
              "idiomatic": "Ying and Cang were transferred to the Ziqing Pinglu circuit, and Bei Prefecture to the Ming–Xiang circuit.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s0017",
          "zh": "未幾，復領瀛、滄二州。",
          "translations": [
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "literal": "Before long, Ying and Cang prefectures were again brought under its jurisdiction.",
              "idiomatic": "Shortly afterward Ying and Cang were restored to its jurisdiction.",
              "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
              "model": "Composer 2.5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "translations": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": ""
        }
      ]
